    *   **Robust Escaping (if variable binding is not feasible):** If direct embedding of user input into the XPath query string is unavoidable, implement robust, context-specific escaping for all user-supplied values. Ensure proper handling of XPath string literal delimiters (single and double quotes) to prevent injection attacks.
