    *   **Disable Network Access:** When parsing XML data using `xmlReadMemory`, explicitly set the `XML_PARSE_NONET` option to prevent the parser from making network requests, thereby mitigating Server-Side Request Forgery (SSRF) vulnerabilities.
    *   **Input Size Validation:** Before parsing, validate the size of the `xml_data` input. Reject excessively large inputs to prevent potential Denial of Service (DoS) attacks due to excessive memory allocation during XML parsing.
